 :drives
 [{:name "Runbooks"
   :files
   [{:path "stripe/webhook-events.md"
     :content "# Stripe events we handle\n\n| event | status field | provisions? |\n|-------|--------------|-------------|\n| checkout.session.completed | complete | yes |\n| invoice.paid | paid | yes |\n| checkout.session.expired | expired | no |\n| invoice.payment_failed | open | no |\n\nThe `status` strings differ between event types for the same business\noutcome. Any handler that checks a single literal will silently drop one\nof the two paths.\n"}
    {:path "stripe/2026-07-alerts.md"
     :content "# Stripe alerting\n\nWe alert on the RATIO of checkout.session.completed events to\nprovisioning writes, not on error rate — a handler that returns 200\nwithout provisioning produces no errors at all.\n\nThreshold: any 15-minute window where the ratio drops below 0.95.\n"}]}]

